__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
.idea/
build/

# uv writes this on every sync and it is deliberately not tracked. A
# library's lockfile reaches no consumer — it is absent from both
# artifacts, and pip resolves from `Requires-Dist` — so all a committed
# one does here is hide the resolution a user actually gets. With
# `pytest` unbounded, a fresh resolve is what makes the local suite the
# gate it is claimed to be. See AGENTS.md, "The environment".
uv.lock

# Open Watcom leavings from building the guest suite. SUITE.EXE is
# checked in deliberately — the objects and the CppUTest library it
# was linked from are not, being reproducible from the makefile.
tests/integration/guest/obj/
tests/integration/guest/*.lib
tests/integration/guest/*.bak
tests/integration/guest/*.map
